---
import {
  BackgroundImage,
} from "astro-imagetools/components";
---

<section
  id={"about"}
  class="py-16"
>
  <div class="py-6">
    <BackgroundImage
      src="src/assets/abstraction3.png"
    >
      <nav class="scroll-mt-24 flex-row items-center gap-4 py-8 px-6 sm:flex hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-col basis-1/3 items-center gap-4">
          <h2
            class="text-center font-extrabold tracking-tight text-6xl highlight-title"
          >
            ABOUT US
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-3 font-medium basis-2/3 text-lg px-2">
          Misael Project was founded by people who are very passionate in developing pop culture industry in Indonesia.
          As such, we are committed to do business with the spirit of professionalism, honesty, and transparency. <br>
          Our aspiration is to be the preferred cooperative partner for Indonesian local creators, in order to contribute to the greater good for the local pop culture industry.
        </div>
      </nav>
      
      <div class="flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col items-center gap-4 py-6 sm:hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 items-center gap-4">
          <h2
            class="text-center font-extrabold tracking-tight text-6xl highlight-title"
          >
            ABOUT US
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-center font-medium max-w-3xl text-lg px-2">
          Misael Project was founded by people who are very passionate in developing pop culture industry in Indonesia.
          As such, we are committed to do business with the spirit of professionalism, honesty, and transparency. <br>
          Our aspiration is to be the preferred cooperative partner for Indonesian local creators, in order to contribute to the greater good for the local pop culture industry.
        </p>
      </div>
    </BackgroundImage>
  </div>
</section>
